        ConfigOption(key: "env.MADEIRA_NLS_EXTRA", title: "Extra code page tables", kind: .bool, defaultValue: "0", category: "Wine core (ntdll)", note: "Default off. 1: a code page table that is not loaded for every game (932, 936, 949, 950, 874, 1250, 1251, 1253-1258) is read from the app's nls/extra folder when the game asks for it; without the line such a request fails (GetCPInfo and MultiByteToWideChar return an error), as before. For a game that converts its text in one of those pages. Logged as [nls-extra]; [nls-missing] names a table that was not found. Read at every request.", choices: [], sources: ["build/ntdll-unix/env_ios.c"]),
