        ConfigOption(key: "env.MADEIRA_SRV_FGETPATH", title: "Name opened files with one call (server)", kind: .bool, defaultValue: "0", category: "Wine core (ntdll)", note: "1: the Wine server takes the path of a file it has just opened from its descriptor (fcntl F_GETPATH) instead of realpath, which checks the path one folder at a time (~0.5 ms a file on the device). Same resolved path; realpath stays the fallback. For games that open many files a second (Horizon Zero Dawn's shader cache in its menu). Off (default): realpath as before. Read at each launch; a later game of the same app run does not inherit it.", choices: [], sources: ["app/Madeira/WineProcessBridge.m", "build/wineserver/fd_ios.c"]),
